([IO-Aware Tiling & Online Softmax Recomputation]) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 702 Tm
(3 FlashAttention Algorithm: Standard Self-Attention \(Vaswani et al., 2017\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 687 Tm
(materializes the N x N attention matrix S = Q K^T and P = softmax\(S\) in slow GPU) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 672 Tm
(High Bandwidth Memory \(HBM\), requiring O\(N^2\) memory accesses. FlashAttention splits) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 657 Tm
(inputs Q, K, V into blocks, loads them from HBM into fast on-chip SRAM, and computes) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 642 Tm
(exact attention using online softmax scaling without ever materializing the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 627 Tm
(intermediate N x N attention matrix in HBM.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 594 Tm
(During the backward pass, by storing the output O and the softmax normalization) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 579 Tm
(statistics \(m, l\) in HBM, FlashAttention recomputes the attention blocks on-chip in) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 564 Tm
(SRAM, reducing HBM memory complexity from O\(N^2\) to linear O\(N\) in sequence length N) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 549 Tm
(while producing the exact same mathematical output as standard attention.) Tj
ET
endstream
